{
 "derivation_summary": "Rule list and directions: the a-priori product vocabulary (TOO_DARK, OVEREXPOSED, BLUR, FROZEN_STATIC, NO_ACTIVE_WORK, HANDS_NOT_VISIBLE, DUPLICATE, CODING_NOISE) plus SHAKY. Thresholds: k x a physical reference measured on TRAINING windows only (median skin fraction, DCT AC energy, global shift, HF share, motion energy), k in {0.75, 2.0}, rounded to an integer at Q=4. Weights: small integers derived by A1 on training clips. t_reject: chosen on training windows under a <=5% false-reject budget.",
 "description": "Deterministic physics rule model v2: fixed integer Q=4 thresholds, fixed integer weights, no learned parameter in the decision path, byte-identical receipts.",
